window.products.push({"id":905014,"name":"Hand Made Genuine Baltic Amber Tree, Home Decor, Gemstone Tree of Life (Large-About 5.12'' Tall), Matte Or Clear Cognac, Champagne, Honey, Sand Or Che","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kgigvQX-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give yourself the element of beauty & joy with our stunning Amber bonsai tree! Baltic amber tree souvenir also known as our “golden tree for success” may be a powerful addition to your feng shui ornament collection and transforming element of your living space. What makes our amber gemstone tree of life stand out? - Made with real natural Baltic amber stone. Comes with our authenticity certificate affirming the amber’s origin. - Intricate natural birch wood base featuring incrustation of little amber pieces known as “tears”. - Unique detailing that makes for a one-of-a-kind amber decor piece. - Comes in a sturdy box ready for you, your loved one, other person or as the collection of amber either decorative tree. About Baltic amber stones! Amber stone found in Baltic countries is known as “Nordic gold”. A prized resin formed about 50 million years ago from coniferous trees, Nordic amber has been used time immemorial to create ceremonial pieces such as the amber glass vase or amber necklace for women. Just a couple of purported benefits of amber stone: - Symbolizes happiness and wellbeing and is a wonderful reminder of the joys of life. - Warms up any space its placed in thanks to its natural rainbow of colors from light honey to deep dark cherry. - Clear amber may create stunning shades under natural sunlight or under your home lighting. - Can induce a sense of peacefulness and calm, and help you ward off negative energy. Sizing Specifications: approx. 4.2” tall with an approx. 3.14” diameter birch wood base. Please note: Each tree bonsai home decor piece is handcrafted from unique stones, which may vary in shape, color, size, texture, and amount from what is shown in pictures. Slight variations are also to be expected in the tree’s natural wood base. Treat yourself to a wonderful happiness tree by scrolling back up & clicking Add to Basket now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kgigvQX-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09MDF1NQS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-905014","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MDF1NQS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MDF1NQS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
