window.products.push({"id":905073,"name":"Roll Up Dish Drying Rack with Utensil Holder WIKISUN Adjustable Stainless Steel Over the Sink Kitchen Dish Drainer Rack Expandable Dish Drying Rack Up","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71smsxrQvYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍉【Adjustable Length Design】The Fully expanded size of the sink dish drying rack length is 22.83 inches and before expanded size is 13 inches (length) x 13 inches (width). The sink-type dish drying rack is suitable of most of sinks,but it is better to confirm the size of the sink before purchasing. 🍒【Extra Storage Baskets】This expanded roll up dish drying rack comes with 1 extra removable storage baskets, no more worries that your spoons, forks, knives, lids, baby's little items will slide into the sink. And the holes on the bottom is for draining well. It can also be used as a temporary storage place for small vegetables and fruits. 🍎【Foldable And Adjustable Design】The foldable and adjustable design of dish drying rack can be rolled up for storage. Expand dish rack to the right size when you use it. After using, you can just wipe it to be dry and roll it up, then store it in cabinet or drawer. 🍓【Stainless Steel And Heat Resistant】Kitchen dish drying rack is temperature resistant, and can resist up to 500℉(260℃). you can run hot water over stainless steel dish rack, and even place hot pot on the dish racks without causing any damage. Dish Rack constructed with 304 stainless steel and baskets made from ABS material which are durable and sturdy can hold up to 22lb. 🍊【Multiple Purpose】WIKISUN roll up dish drying sink rack not only can be used as a dish drainer for drying kitchenware, such as washed bowls, pans, glasses, cups, plates, cookware, cutlery; but also as a vegetable colander to fruit and vegetables; or as a non-slip trivet mat for hot pots or bakeware on countertop.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71smsxrQvYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WIKISUN","source_asin":"B099NFKCC4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-905073","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099NFKCC4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099NFKCC4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
