window.products.push({"id":905115,"name":"Kunaboo Bamboo Charcuterie Board Set-Green Ramekins-Climate Pledge Friendly Certified Cheese Board with Knife Set (FSC Certified eco-Friendly Bamboo)-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vAxkFq5BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KUNABOO cheeseboard is the only bamboo cheese board and knife set that is Climate Pledge Friendy certified and uses 100% Forest Stewardship Council (FSC) certified material; All our bamboo is grown and harvested in the most eco-friendly and ethical way Highlight of every party: A 5-star luxury experience hosted in your own home; the perfect complement to delicious food, joyful laughter and authentic company; Serve the ultimate platter of cheese and snacks with the KUNABOO all natural bamboo cheeseboard and knife set; slice, cut and spread with a 4 piece stainless steel cutlery set; 2 ceramic bowls ideal for dipping and snacks such as salsa and olives The perfect gift: This cheese tray and knife set comes in ready-to-wrap plastic-free packaging box; perfect for the ethical consumer and those who enjoy sharing the finer things in life with family and friends; ideal for housewarming, Christmas and wedding gifts. The best design on the market! The KUNABOO wine and cheese board has a special mechanism which holds the cutlery drawer in so it will not slide out when moved around; This allows you to safely present the serving platter full of food while mingling, chatting and even holding a glass of wine. Unlike other products, the Kunaboo drawer opens seamlessly with one hand under the tray, allowing you to access the knives without disturbing the food display. Risk-free guarantee: KUNABOO has sourced the highest quality bamboo, engaged the most experienced craftsmen and optimized the design, to ensure that you receive the best bamboo cheese board with cutlery set on the market! There will be no cracking, peeling or warping. There is an industry-high 3-year manufacture backed warranty. We also offer a 100% money back guarantee if you are not completely satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vAxkFq5BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KUNABOO","source_asin":"B0958KTF9J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-905115","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0958KTF9J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0958KTF9J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":905116,"name":"KidKraft® Limited Edition Toy Chest, WHITE","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31SFvLnUHvL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description This space-saving toy box/bench provides both a place for little ones to take a break, and a place for them to store their toys. The lid opens to generous storage space for toys, clothes, blankets and more. The spindle back adds charm, as well as back support. Casters provide easy mobility. Coordinate with the white spindle table and chair set and storage clock, each sold separately, for a charming child's room. Made from wood and wood composite. Imported.33.07\"Lx18.38\"Wx27.75\"H Seat:16.38\"H From the Manufacturer Offering style and storage, our Limited Edition Toy Chest has a large, generous space for organizing toys, games, and books. The flip-top lid has a secure safety hinge to protect kids fingers from getting caught. Plus, with a gracefully arched back, the Limited Edition Toy Chest is sturdy enough to double as a bench for extra seating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31SFvLnUHvL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KidKraft","source_asin":"B0001XJUUC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-905116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001XJUUC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001XJUUC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
