window.products.push({"id":905253,"name":"Milk Frother Handheld for Coffee, Foam Maker Electric Whisk Drink Mixer for Lattes, Cappuccino, Frappe, Matcha, Hot Chocolate (Black), 8.7x2.08x2.08 i","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AzcCEbmaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Macchiato Top a shot of espresso with a spoonful of milk foam. Cafe au lait Pour hot frothed milk into your favorite brewed coffee in a 1:3 ratio. Cappuccino Top a shot of espresso with equal parts hot milk and milk foam. Latte Top a shot of espresso with hot milk, adding milk foam on top. Cold Foam Iced Tea Combine cold milk, cream, and sugar using your frother. Pour on top of iced tea. Matcha Green Tea With your frother, combine matcha powder, water, and sugar. Mix with hot milk and froth again. Hot Cocoa Microwave milk and chocolate until warm and chocolate is melted, about a minute. Mix and froth. Dalgona Coffee Use your frother to combine instant coffee, sugar, and water until light and fluffy. Dollop on top of hot or cold milk.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AzcCEbmaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09XBBRGPX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-905253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XBBRGPX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XBBRGPX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":905254,"name":"MultiOutools 3-Tier Chocolate Fountain Party Fountain, chocolate fountain for Nacho Cheese BBQ Sauce Ranch Liqueurs, Stainless Steel Chocolate Fondue ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615rAdYr7PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CHOCOLATE FONDUE FUN —— A party wouldn’t be perfect without chocolate fountain! Tasty chocolate-coated foods are great for birthday parties, date night, movies night, family gatherings, wedding register, or enjoy alone. It is REALLY GREAT for dipping fruit, breads, vegetables, cotton candy, biscuit, and other dessert. Dress up your strawberries with chocolate shell, chocolate-covered fruits make for sweet snack for summer. HOW TO USE —— Melt the chocolate in the microwave first. At the same time, turn on the HEAT switch to warm up the machine for 3-5 minutes. Then slowly pour the melting chocolate into the stainless steel pan of the machine (up to 8oz). Now you can turn on the MOTOR switch and enjoy your chocolate fountain.【TIPS: Adding some edible oil would make the chocolate flows silkily.】 GREAT FOR PARTIES —— This chocolate fountain machine is perfect for birthday parties, wedding registry, Christmas family gatherings, barbecue activities. It is not just a chocolate fountain, you can also have a flowing fountain of nacho cheese, ranch, BBQ sauce, and liqueur. Simply assemble the chocolate fountain machine and dip strawberries, cherries, apple wedges, marshmallows, cookies, pretzels, wings, vegetables, etc. UNIQUE DESIGN —— This chocolate fountain machine has a plate on the bottom, which is convenient than others. Simply assemble this 3 tiers fountain and set it up on the tabletop, put strawberries, cherries, popcorn, etc on the plate, and dip the food. You can also put the dipped fruits on the plate till the chocolate on it freeze. GIFT GIVING —— Chocolate fountain is perfect for birthday parties, weddings, holiday activities, and family gatherings. It is a great choice for kids’ birthday gifts, friends’ birthday party gifts. Buy one for your parties and activities all year round. No one would say “NO” to a chocolate fountain or sauce fountain!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615rAdYr7PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MultiOutools","source_asin":"B09J8RY9KP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-905254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J8RY9KP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J8RY9KP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
