window.products.push({"id":905279,"name":"Well Woven Tabitha Vintage Beige & Grey Distressed Oriental Medallion Area Rug 2x7 Runner (2'7\" x 7'3\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GrR6Kc8eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Velvety smooth 0.3\" pile. Stain and fade resistant polypropylene yarn with wood-floor-safe cotton backing. This size is recommended as a hall or entry runner. For best results, use in halls 35\" - 50\" wide. Vintage traditional design with soft, understated colors and a distressed, antique look. Arrives factory rolled, may have minor creases from tight packaging and compression during storage. Normally flattens within 3-5 days in warm weather and 5-7 in cooler seasons. Reduce or remove by rolling, pattern side up, and massaging by hand to loosen the backing and help ease it flat. Try laying the rug out in a sunny room first, heat helps further loosen the backing. Super easy to clean! For spills, remove excess material and blot stain with a clean cloth dampened with lukewarm water. Never rub as this will move stains deeper into the fiber, making them harder harder to remove. Repeat process with a solution of lukewarm water and dish detergent. Finish by blotting with water and finally a clean white cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GrR6Kc8eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Well Woven","source_asin":"B07L8MZY6F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-905279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L8MZY6F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L8MZY6F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
