window.products.push({"id":905399,"name":"Single Decora Blue Mesh Talavera Switch Plate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415yHZygg8L._AC_.jpg","description":"Mexican Talavera ceramic is the result of a mixture of cultures over time. Initially, the Spaniards were influenced by Arabic pottery.They brought it with them to Mexico.The mixture of these cultures resulted in this beautiful ceramic art. This ceramic decora switch plate is a great present-time example of the exquisite beauty Mexican craftsmen put into each item they create.The ceramic is fired at high temperatures to give it its hardness.Most of the Talavera ceramic items are first hand-painted with a white coat.The decoration is then drawn over the first coat of paint. You may find that it has some imperfections, due to its hand-made nature, but it is what it makes it unique. Because of its nature, no two switch plates are exactly the same! There may be small variations in size, weight and color. This switch plate makes for a unique accent to any hacienda, country, or southwestern style home. This particular design is painted in colorful strokes with a blue background.This switch plate will go well with the Rebozo Talavera Ceramic Sink. It will fit any standard single decora switch plate. If you want to delight somebody special with a unique handcrafted gift, this is what you are looking for! All of our Talavera Mexican switch plates come with ivory-painted head screws.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415yHZygg8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fine Crafts Imports","source_asin":"B00VVW2JSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-905399","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VVW2JSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VVW2JSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
