window.products.push({"id":905813,"name":"CSBD Stemless Wine Tumbler with Lid and Reusable Straw, 12 ounce, Insulated Stainless Steel Double Walled Drink Cup, Includes Cleaning Brush (White, 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tFITp9avL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Classic Insulated Wine Tumbler: Ideal for parties, relaxing on the couch, or enjoying a backyard barbecue this stainless steel wine tumbler is great for red or white wine, coffee, juice, water, or other adult cocktails. Spill Resistant Lid with Reusable Straw: our tumblers comes with a heavy duty, easy sip plastic lid that’s safe, durable, and contains no BPAs. It also features a reusable stainless steel straw that’s better for the environment. Insulated Double Wall Design: Designed with maximum temperature retention this insulated mom wine tumbler helps your white wine stay cold and crisp or your hot coffee stay piping warm for optimal taste. Complementary Cleaning Brush: These insulated tumblers are rust and corrosion resistant, super durable, and indoor and outdoor safe. They also come with a soft cleaning brush to make washing them quick and easy. Trusted Quality Assurance: CSBD is focused on providing the highest-quality products backed by the most responsive service possible. Let us know if there are any issues and we’ll make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tFITp9avL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CSBD","source_asin":"B07RV3PV47","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-905813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RV3PV47","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RV3PV47","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":905814,"name":"Millenium Linen 4 Piece Bed Sheet Set - Double Brushed Microfiber (Burgundy, Twin)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31JMZivQhML._AC_.jpg","description":"Wrap yourself in luxury when you sleep with the Millenium Linen 4-Piece Bed Sheet Set . Stylish, soft and extremely comfortable , these sheets will keep you warm at night while adding a luxurious touch of style to your bedroom ensemble. To provide long-lasting strength and optimal comfort, these sheets are made using double brushed microfiber . This makes the set feel like cotton – extremely soft against your skin to keep you comfortable all night long. Absorbent and lint free , the material is durable, lightweight and breathable . Plus, it will keep you warm when the temperature drops at night. Fitted sheets tend to pop off the corners, leading to an uncomfortable night of sleep. With Millenium Linen, you won’t have that problem. These deep pocket sheets are deeper than your average sheets, especially in the corners. This construction allows the sheet to stretch over a thick mattress up to 15 inches , supplying a proper fit without coming off . For added convenience, these sheets come in four convenient sizes to accommodate all mattresses. The 3-piece twin set includes a flat sheet, fitted sheet and pillowcase, while the full, queen and king 4-piece sets come complete with a flat sheet, fitted sheet and two pillowcases. They are also available in nine, beautiful color options – white, beige, sage, light blue, silver, coffee, black, gold and burgundy – to ensure a perfect shade for everyone. To top it off, the Millenium Linen Sheet Set boasts a dobby stripe pattern . This simple yet sleek design adds an elegant touch of texture to your bed, sure to enrich any interior setting. Soft and luxurious , you will feel like you’re sleeping on cloud nine .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31JMZivQhML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Millenium Linen","source_asin":"B078VWBJTQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-905814","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078VWBJTQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078VWBJTQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
