window.products.push({"id":905901,"name":"LUXEAR Pillowcase - 2 Pack Envelope Closure Cooling Pillowcases with Double-Side Design [Arc-Chill Cooling & Cotton Fiber], Anti-Static, Skin-Friendly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ho2p1N0BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️【 COOLING MATERIAL 】- This pillowcase is made of special Japanese Q-Max >0.4 Arc-Chill Cooling Fibers. The larger the Q-max value, the more heat the fabric takes away. That’s why the LUXEAR's cooling pillowcase is the best at absorbing body heat to transfer away from you as you sleep. Better yet: our Cooling Fibers material is naturally anti-static, meaning it will significantly reduce “bed head” — you will wake up with smoother, frizz-free hair every morning. ❄️【ENVELOPE CLOSURE END DESIGN】- It prevents your comfy pillows escaping from pillowcases set of 2 during your sweet dream - No zipper with easy on and off design speed up your pillow-changing process to bring a pleasant experience. ❄️【 DOUBLE-SIDED DESIGN 】- This pillowcase has a double-sided design, perfect for all seasons. The cooling side of the pillowcase is silky and cool, perfect for hot summer. It’s especially helpful for people who suffer from night sweats every night. The other side is made of 100% cotton fabric, comfortable and soft — perfect for the whole family, to help you relax and sleep better every night. ❄️【 PERFECT FOR HAIR & SKIN 】- Our special Cooling Fibers material is tightly woven, to make this pillowcase naturally anti-static. The tight weave allows the skin and hair to slide over the pillowcase very gently and freely, helping to reduce facial wrinkles, preventing dry or knotted hair, significantly reducing “bed head,” and resulting in smoother, frizz-free hair every morning. ❄️【 WHAT YOU GET 】- 2 PACK (20\"x 30\") queen size pillowcases. [ Japanese Arc-Chill Cooling Fabric]: Arc-Chill Cool Technology Fabric can quickly absorb human body heat, when the human body touches the fabric, the body surface temperature immediately drops by about 2 to 5 degrees.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ho2p1N0BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUXEAR","source_asin":"B08X3H4HS8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-905901","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X3H4HS8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X3H4HS8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
