window.products.push({"id":905962,"name":"Home Soft Things Printed Micro Plush Throw for The Bundle of Joy, 50\" x 60\", Multi Zombie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K37MsrR-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Multi-Zombie Micro Plush Throw is super soft and lightweight perfect for travel, as a kids blankets, or even a baby blanket. This throw features all types of cool and crazy zombies including a professional working woman zombie, construction worker zombie, clown zombie, and even a soccer playing zombie. This proves that all zombies are not alike and can be very regular citizens of society. Zombie lovers need this throw, especially when they are ready for a chili night watching \"The Walking Dead\" or other great zombie horror movies. This blanket is made of Microfiber Polyester and is extremely super soft to the touch. The fabric also gets softer and softer on additional washes. Between washes, the color will not fade because of the heat treated color lock between the print and the fabric of the blanket. The blanket is a standard 50 inch by 60 inch size and will last a lifetime with proper care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K37MsrR-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Soft Things","source_asin":"B013N75V7I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-905962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013N75V7I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013N75V7I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":905963,"name":"Convertible Sofa Chair Folding Bed 5 Position Adjustable Backrest Sturdy Sleeper Chair with Pillow for Bedroom Firm Legs Armrest Chaise Lounge Indoor ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+25pCfo5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Folding sofa chair bed: Sleeper chair features a back that will recline to a flat position, at about 45 degrees to watch TV, down to about 30 degrees to lounge. The sofa chair folds out and folds back up quickly and easily and has 5-position degrees of incline for the back-rest. Use it as an armchair, chaise lounge, or bed. Sturdy chair for bedroom: Chair materials and construction are simple but very sturdy, you would appreciate the strength and quality of the linen fabric. This chair fabric will stand up to a long time of use. Meanwhile, this reclining sofa is well made with sturdy metal frame and well finished in details, it’s firm for the solid build quality. Firm Sofa bed: If you prefer a firm/hard mattress for sleep, this sofa bed is wonderful. The firm foam works in your favor as dense foam gives the sofa better longevity. This chair bed is comfortable(but firm) for sleeping and sitting and has an easy folding mechanism. Sofa chair is easy to convert into a bed, and it converts the studio or office into a room you can really relax, read or sleep in. Minimalist sofa chair for small spaces: Versatility of this chair and bed combination, this sofa chair is great for limited spaces that can’t accommodate a full-sized pull-out couch. Overall chair size 22\"L x 22\"W x 33\"H, the chair fits into a small space with folding from a sitting position to a bed configuration. This sofa chair as a relatively inexpensive solution to having occasional guests. Easy to assemble: This chair will arrive almost fully assembled, just need you to attach the legs and armrests. We provide customers the best products and services, if any problems with our products, please do not hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+25pCfo5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"4EVERWINNER","source_asin":"B08S37DF4D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-905963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S37DF4D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S37DF4D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
